  "is_prerecorded": false,
  "description": "It’s hot outside and school’s still out in the Convergence Zone, so let’s swim in some ambient Berlin School to settle in and chill out\n\nI’ve got new space music from local heavyweights Terminus Void and Dreamstate Logic, from a compilation to sustain the mental health of astronauts\n\nGlorious ambient from Portland artists Dao Strom and The OO-Ray, and from Angela Winter\n\nWith new Berlin School from Christian Fiesel, Perge, and Brendan Pollard\n\nConvergence Zone arrives every Tuesday night at 8:30pm PT on 90.7 KSER, 89.9 KXIR, streaming around the universe at kser.org, TuneIn, and those damned smart speakers too",
